W911 Linux Configurator
=======================

This project is a derivative of the Syntax Keyboard Configurator:

    https://github.com/syntaxfm/keyboard

Copyright (c) 2026 CJ Reynolds, licensed under the MIT License.
The original project targets the W909 macro pad; this version adds W911
layout/geometry, the 7-shaped ENTER, knob/roller mapping, Chinese UI and
several workflow changes.

The W911/W909 USB HID protocol, key matrix mapping and the keycap dimensions
were derived from the vendor software and from a user-supplied STEP model.
No vendor software or firmware is included in this repository.

This is an unofficial project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
keyboard manufacturer. It writes settings directly to the device; back up
your configuration before experimenting.
